        "faqs": {
            "q1": "How do I upgrade to the Pro plan?",
            "a1": "You can upgrade by accessing the \"Billing\" tab in the sidebar and clicking \"Upgrade\". We accept credit cards via Stripe.",
            "q2": "Can I cancel my subscription at any time?",
            "a2": "Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time through the billing dashboard. Pro access will remain active until the end of the paid period.",
            "q3": "How do I change my profile theme?",
            "a3": "Go to the \"Design\" tab in the side or top menu. There you will find options to change themes, colors, fonts, and button styles.",
